# ============================================================================
# Firebase Configuration for Fytwiz App
# ============================================================================
#
# IMPORTANT: You MUST replace the placeholder values below with your actual
# Firebase credentials. The app will NOT work with these placeholder values!
#
# ============================================================================
# HOW TO GET YOUR FIREBASE CREDENTIALS:
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. Go to https://console.firebase.google.com/
# 2. Select your project (fytwiz-rhl3101)
# 3. Click the gear icon ⚙️ → "Project Settings"
# 4. Scroll down to "Your apps" section
# 5. Find your web app (or click "Add app" to create one)
# 6. You'll see a code snippet with firebaseConfig object
# 7. Copy each value from there to here
#
# ============================================================================
# EXAMPLE OF WHAT YOUR VALUES SHOULD LOOK LIKE:
# ============================================================================
#
# VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=AIzaSyD4sJdhARoFthYCztOLAPedjsB1typPcXs
# VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=fytwiz-rhl3101.firebaseapp.com
# VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=fytwiz-rhl3101
# VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=fytwiz-rhl3101.firebasestorage.app
# VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=792457556112
# VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=1:792457556112:web:d8e5ab672bd93254a5e815
# VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=G-E475NG18J6
#
# ⚠️  SECURITY NOTE: After entering your credentials here, the old exposed
#     API key should be rotated. See FIREBASE_KEY_ROTATION.md for instructions.
#
# ============================================================================
# YOUR CONFIGURATION (Replace the values below with YOUR actual values)
# ============================================================================

# Your Firebase API Key (starts with "AIzaSy...")
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=your_api_key_here

# Your Auth Domain (usually your-project-id.firebaseapp.com)
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=your_auth_domain_here

# Your Project ID (found in Firebase Console Project Settings)
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=your_project_id_here

# Your Storage Bucket (usually your-project-id.firebasestorage.app)
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=your_storage_bucket_here

# Your Messaging Sender ID (numeric value)
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=your_messaging_sender_id_here

# Your App ID (starts with "1:" and contains "web:")
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=your_app_id_here

# Your Measurement ID (starts with "G-")
VITE_FIREBASE_MEASUREMENT_ID=your_measurement_id_here

# ============================================================================
# AFTER FILLING IN YOUR VALUES:
# ============================================================================
#
# 1. Save this file
# 2. Deploy Firestore rules: firebase deploy --only firestore:rules
# 3. Start your app: npm run dev
# 4. Test that everything works
# 5. Read FIREBASE_KEY_ROTATION.md to rotate the exposed API key
#
# ⚠️  NEVER commit the .env file to Git! It's already in .gitignore
#
# ============================================================================
